<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:blogger='http://schemas.google.com/blogger/2008' xmlns:georss='http://www.georss.org/georss' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005" xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0'><title>Brand Eating</title><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-985211008331005934.post-1430098375574770264</id><published>2026-10-22T13:00:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2026-10-23T10:23:07.812-07:00</updated><category scheme="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#" term="Chick-fil-A"/><category scheme="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#" term="News"/><title type='text'>Chick-fil-A Unveils New Spicy Chick-fil-A Sauce</title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhQHWVIY2M8uQlA2Zlof0WxsbG8BjZIK4uEAWVG3WAH-GDFV_NIim9M6umKQlOeW89sZ0JpIegRigUFSJAFbTSLbBuY5qVgvjF2lgZxEcOilRXlNcgDqtwrCQP3-NUIgTKWBSlttYbz0M1Mgr2UtOWJtU6nlrlL-nkM90pWR8A2Ts9OG70YGXNsCbKgj4E/s640/new-spicy-chick-fil-a-sauce.jpg&quot; imageanchor=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;clear: right; float: right; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;New Spicy Chick-fil-A Sauce.&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;441&quot; data-original-width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;276&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhQHWVIY2M8uQlA2Zlof0WxsbG8BjZIK4uEAWVG3WAH-GDFV_NIim9M6umKQlOeW89sZ0JpIegRigUFSJAFbTSLbBuY5qVgvjF2lgZxEcOilRXlNcgDqtwrCQP3-NUIgTKWBSlttYbz0M1Mgr2UtOWJtU6nlrlL-nkM90pWR8A2Ts9OG70YGXNsCbKgj4E/w400-h276/new-spicy-chick-fil-a-sauce.jpg&quot; width=&quot;400&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.brandeating.com/search/label/Chick-fil-A&quot;&gt;Chick-fil-A&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt; will be launching a &lt;b&gt;new spicy version of its signature Chick-fil-A Sauce&lt;/b&gt; nationwide starting November 16, 2026.&lt;span&gt;&lt;a name=&#39;more&#39;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A permanent menu addition, &lt;b&gt;Spicy Chick-fil-A Sauce&lt;/b&gt; is described as &quot;a bolder version of our classic dipping sauce with mustard notes and a smoky tang, balanced by subtle sweetness and infused with spicy peppers.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The new sauce will be available in standard dipping cups and 8-oz bottles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Photo via Chick-fil-A.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;blogger-post-footer&quot;&gt;Read more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.brandeating.com&quot;&gt;Brand Eating&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='https://www.brandeating.com/feeds/1430098375574770264/comments/default' title='Post Comments'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='https://www.brandeating.com/2026/10/new-spicy-chick-fil-a-sauce.html#comment-form' title='0 Comments'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='https://www.blogger.com/feeds/985211008331005934/posts/default/1430098375574770264'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='https://www.blogger.com/feeds/985211008331005934/posts/default/1430098375574770264'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='https://www.brandeating.com/2026/10/new-spicy-chick-fil-a-sauce.html' title='Chick-fil-A Unveils New Spicy Chick-fil-A Sauce'/><author><name>Q</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07359751823412936738</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhQHWVIY2M8uQlA2Zlof0WxsbG8BjZIK4uEAWVG3WAH-GDFV_NIim9M6umKQlOeW89sZ0JpIegRigUFSJAFbTSLbBuY5qVgvjF2lgZxEcOilRXlNcgDqtwrCQP3-NUIgTKWBSlttYbz0M1Mgr2UtOWJtU6nlrlL-nkM90pWR8A2Ts9OG70YGXNsCbKgj4E/s72-w400-h276-c/new-spicy-chick-fil-a-sauce.jpg" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-985211008331005934.post-241512766550971407</id><published>2026-10-22T11:00:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2026-10-23T10:08:06.763-07:00</updated><category scheme="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#" term="Limited-Time"/><category scheme="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#" term="News"/><category scheme="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#" term="Pizza Hut"/><title type='text'>Cheesy Bites Stuffed Crust is Back at Pizza Hut</title><content type='html'>&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiEtQm41I0eYC8IZpOIwbwYbbqIOC2getjTpDN9qUIG0gydawY0_FCRLshi8ylZMmhHYwaHd_SaTuqnvSL9N0pYJJ9E6HV_qf8eO2F-MR9sSzRtiDZdm-VuhBEul6lpY1ddnI8EPgpr9-zmIgpagI-blbrIIETwhn3Eg2Xw9om-ssgSHUV1THl4FjL5eTQ/s640/pizza-hut-cheesy-bites-stuffed-crust-pizza.jpg&quot; imageanchor=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;clear: right; float: right; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;Pizza Hut&#39;s Cheesy Bites Stuffed Crust Pizza.&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;334&quot; data-original-width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;209&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiEtQm41I0eYC8IZpOIwbwYbbqIOC2getjTpDN9qUIG0gydawY0_FCRLshi8ylZMmhHYwaHd_SaTuqnvSL9N0pYJJ9E6HV_qf8eO2F-MR9sSzRtiDZdm-VuhBEul6lpY1ddnI8EPgpr9-zmIgpagI-blbrIIETwhn3Eg2Xw9om-ssgSHUV1THl4FjL5eTQ/w400-h209/pizza-hut-cheesy-bites-stuffed-crust-pizza.jpg&quot; width=&quot;400&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;The &lt;b&gt;Cheesy Bites Stuffed Crust Pizza&lt;/b&gt; is back at &lt;b&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.brandeating.com/search/label/Pizza%20Hut&quot;&gt;Pizza Hut&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt; for a limited time at participating locations.&lt;span&gt;&lt;a name=&#39;more&#39;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The hand-tossed crust is ringed with 28 cheese-stuffed bites along its edge and comes with marinara for dipping.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Prices vary, but a&amp;nbsp; large 1-topping Cheesy Bites Stuffed Crust Pizza costs $13.99 near me in Los Angeles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can find &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.brandeating.com/2010/11/review-pizza-hut-cheesy-bites-pizza.html&quot;&gt;my review of it all the way back in 2010 here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Photo via Pizza Hut.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;blogger-post-footer&quot;&gt;Read more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.brandeating.com&quot;&gt;Brand Eating&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/div&gt;</content><link rel='replies' type='application/atom+xml' href='https://www.brandeating.com/feeds/241512766550971407/comments/default' title='Post Comments'/><link rel='replies' type='text/html' href='https://www.brandeating.com/2026/10/pizza-hut-cheesy-bites-stuffed-crust-pizza-returns-fall-2026.html#comment-form' title='0 Comments'/><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='https://www.blogger.com/feeds/985211008331005934/posts/default/241512766550971407'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='https://www.blogger.com/feeds/985211008331005934/posts/default/241512766550971407'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='https://www.brandeating.com/2026/10/pizza-hut-cheesy-bites-stuffed-crust-pizza-returns-fall-2026.html' title='Cheesy Bites Stuffed Crust is Back at Pizza Hut'/><author><name>Q</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07359751823412936738</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiEtQm41I0eYC8IZpOIwbwYbbqIOC2getjTpDN9qUIG0gydawY0_FCRLshi8ylZMmhHYwaHd_SaTuqnvSL9N0pYJJ9E6HV_qf8eO2F-MR9sSzRtiDZdm-VuhBEul6lpY1ddnI8EPgpr9-zmIgpagI-blbrIIETwhn3Eg2Xw9om-ssgSHUV1THl4FjL5eTQ/s72-w400-h209-c/pizza-hut-cheesy-bites-stuffed-crust-pizza.jpg" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total></entry></feed>